[Tips.ボックスリサイズσ@Resize_S]
effect.name=Applies zoom filter to fit a rectangle of the specified size.
背景サイズ=Fits to the screen size, ignoring the settings of width and height.
水平揃え=Valid only when "Margin/Clipping" is turned on. Adjusts the size of margin/clipping.
垂直揃え=Valid only when "Margin/Clipping" is turned on. Adjusts the size of margin/clipping.
余白/クリッピング=When the aspect ratios do not match, leaves extra margin or clips out-of-bound part.
